sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor User
    participant API as API service
    participant Temporal as Temporal service
    participant Worker as Worker
    participant Postgres as Postgres
    participant Kafka as Kafka topic
    participant Projector as Projection worker
    participant TiDB as TiDB serving

    User->>API: POST /orders
    API->>Temporal: Start OrderWorkflow
    Temporal-->>Worker: Schedule activity task
    Worker->>Postgres: Insert order and outbox row
    Worker-->>Temporal: Activity completed
    Worker->>Kafka: Publish order.created
    Kafka-->>Projector: Deliver event
    Projector->>TiDB: Upsert order projection
    Temporal-->>API: Workflow result
    API-->>User: 202 Accepted
